{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"『16人のプリンシパル』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"千秋楽を迎えることができました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初この公演をやると聞いた時"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素直に嬉しかった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと夢だった公演。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16ポジション"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日立ち位置が変わって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にできるの！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と不安でいっぱいでしたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとか無事最後まで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やり遂げることができました(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に自己PRは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなが悩んだ所だと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『自分の気持ちを伝えればいいんだよ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悩む私たちに 周りはそう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アドバイスをたくさんくれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相談に乗ってくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんも コメントで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうしたらいいんじゃない？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と たくさん意見をくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伝えたいことはちゃんとあるのに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上手くできなくて 最初は自分に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自信を無くしていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど9公演 やっていく内に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何だか分かった気がします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何か確かな答えみたいなのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はっきりとはないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分で信じた事を自信を持って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やり遂げることが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1番大